  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a home in one of Takapuna's most sought-after, quiet streets. This freestanding, single-level residence offers an exceptional balance of space, sun and simplicity-just moments from the energy of the village and coastline.\r\nThoughtfully designed for ease of living, the home features two bedrooms, a well-appointed kitchen and bathroom, and the convenience of internal access garaging, complemented by additional off-street parking. The single-level layout ensures comfort now and into the future.\r\nLight-filled living and dining areas flow effortlessly to both front and rear outdoor spaces, creating seamless indoor-outdoor living without the burden of high maintenance. Whether hosting friends, enjoying a quiet coffee, or relaxing in the sun, these spaces are private, practical and inviting.\r\nEqually appealing to downsizers seeking space without compromise, professionals, or small families, this home offers a low-maintenance lifestyle in a premium location.\r\nPositioned within easy walking distance of Takapuna Beach, the lake, shops, cafés and restaurants, it delivers lifestyle, location and long-term livability in equal measure.\r\nNow priced to reflect both quality and opportunity, this is an offering that invites genuine interest. Freestanding homes of this calibre, in such a central position, remain tightly held and consistently in demand.",
